<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.53		 42.58</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	68.00		 68.10</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 27.90		 27.95</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.373		 0.375</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.30		 11.32</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.56		 11.58</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.13		  1.15</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 6.10 pct	    6.30 pct</p>
